[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
suexec of apache24: libexec/apache24/mod_suexec.so and sbin/suexec (setuid root,
only the user www may run it; the docroot /var/www, suexec -V for the rest).
Load it into an Apache instance:
  LoadModule suexec_module libexec/apache24/mod_suexec.so
and give a virtual host its user and group with SuexecUserGroup (or use it as
FastCgiWrapper of mod_fastcgi).
EOM
}
]
